#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:176
msgid "Deleting Images"
msgstr "Ta bort bilder"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:178
msgid ""
"An image element, floating above a worksheet, can be deleted from the "
"worksheet and from the <application>Gnumeric</application> file using the "
"context menu. The procedure for deleting all graphical elements is the same;"
" this procedure is explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"deleting\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ta bort en bild som flyter ovanför kalkylbladet från både "
"kalkylbladet och <application>Gnumeric</application>-filen via snabbmenyn. "
"Samma metod används för att ta bort alla grafiska element; den beskrivs i "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-deleting\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "GUI Widgets"
msgstr "Gränssnittskomponenter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"A <application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet can graphical user interface"
" (GUI) elements, commonly called 'widgets', which can be tied to the data "
"contents of worksheet cells. For example, users can add a slider widget "
"which, when the position of the slider moves, alters the numeric value in a "
"worksheet cell."
msgstr ""
"Ett kalkylblad i <application>Gnumeric</application> kan innehålla grafiska "
"gränssnittskomponenter som är kopplade till cellernas data. Du kan till "
"exempel lägga till ett skjutreglage som ändrar talvärdet i en cell när du "
"flyttar reglaget."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:13
msgid "Widgets are currently experimental!"
msgstr "Gränssnittskomponenterna är fortfarande experimentella!"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:14
msgid ""
"The current implementation of these widgets is incomplete. Some of the "
"obvious configuration settings for these widgets do not exist and much of "
"the functionality that these widgets should exhibit has not been "
"implemented. Future versions of <application>Gnumeric</application> will "
"complete these widgets and make them functional."
msgstr ""
"Den nuvarande implementationen av gränssnittskomponenterna är ofullständig. "
"Vissa självklara inställningar saknas och mycket av den avsedda "
"funktionaliteten har ännu inte implementerats. Framtida versioner av "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> ska färdigställa komponenterna och göra "
"dem fullt användbara."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:25
msgid "Widgets do not currently stack properly on the worksheet"
msgstr ""
"Gränssnittskomponenterna staplas för närvarande inte korrekt i kalkylbladet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:28
msgid ""
"Widgets currently stay above all the other graphical elements because they "
"use a different system to calculate their positions than the other graphical"
" elements do. This will also be fixed in future updates."
msgstr ""
"Gränssnittskomponenterna ligger alltid ovanför de andra grafiska elementen "
"eftersom deras positioner beräknas med ett annat system. Även detta kommer "
"att rättas i framtida uppdateringar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:38 C/gnumeric.xml:22
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be added by selecting the appropriate icon on the"
" object toolbar and using the thin cross-hair mouse pointer to place the "
"element on the worksheet by clicking or by click-dragging with the primary "
"mouse button. This process is explained in greater detail in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-adding\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan lägga till varje sådan komponent genom att välja motsvarande ikon i "
"objektverktygsfältet och placera den i kalkylbladet med det tunna hårkorset."
" Klicka eller klicka och dra med den primära musknappen. Processen beskrivs "
"utförligare i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-adding\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:47 C/gnumeric.xml:31
msgid ""
"Each of these elements can be configured using the context menu and its "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item, as explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-modifing\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera varje komponent via snabbmenyns menyalternativ "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem>, enligt beskrivningen i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-modifing\"/>."
